#: bac8c44103114225b03ebd432925e4f4 e8b2cc1b176c4d27a4958e1b861b2255
msgid ""
"Note: If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART2 TX "
"pin , RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and SERIAL2_OPTIONS must be set to 7 (invert "
"TX/RX, half duplex). For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX1 and TX1 and"
" set RSSI_TYPE also to 3."
msgstr ""
"注意：若接收机为FPort，则接收机必须连接到USART2 "
"TX引脚，RSSI_TYPE设置为3，SERIAL2_OPTIONS必须设置为7（反相TX/RX，半双工）。对于CRSF/ELRS等全双工协议，同时使用RX1和TX1，RSSI_TYPE也设置为3。"

