msgstr "图传电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:122
#: 030f7eb84edf4c74a44a552579d9c432 3672a6d0b28c43a99be5bed5f07206f6
#: 83060c5878cf4647a4a3843c3eb84782 bb9cd7936e5246439c49e9e747699317
#: d2b9f76ef99f45ba8d5b06d3fff15aed f41db1f38e4046b08778ce390d52419b
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"10V\". Setting this "
"GPIO low removes voltage supply to pins. By default RELAY2 is configured to "
"control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制标有「10V」引脚的 VTX BEC 输出。将此 GPIO 拉低将断开该引脚的供电。默认情况下，RELAY2 配置为控制此引脚并将 "
"GPIO 拉高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:126
#: 6249a199f5474483beb2050e6fd208a0 653dbdbb754e4fe5860439a1b4cc6720
#: 6f1fde8b6a4a452d8266b8c96a236dc1 88e2d5e4046b4d95850529705047028d
#: 8956d297e89042a99b18474b2c621eea f24f693fe9a4410e97d89f5c64afdae4
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:128
#: 19cb92bd74a64528b75c00956040b054 3d7efac865354872bbad198d2b7e7d44
#: 4568a6d7196d4cd88cbc9fd012b61ca2 6991797cd16b4318aa425a9ce33135f2
#: 6eba8f3128da41ea8402062a690dcaf2 85050ba1ebae43cf922b282d1aa3212b
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制相机输出到标记为「CAM1」和「CAM2」的连接器。将此 GPIO 设置为低电平可将视频输出从 CAM1 切换到 "
"CAM2。默认情况下，RELAY3 配置为控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:131
#: 063ac4f9060b493189fabee9473f8544 21384194eedb45138e85056868f0f510
#: 24073c355c7e48399190aa326999665b 9c1e2f8b7bac478396faf66b1eeaf67e
