msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:133
#: 17f26c7bf5b94e139b780beb4241279c 42f8b643ba7840768662029c47c0be94
#: 6d44e64b81a14a6781c96d0447ba3f27 8fe899843b5c4dc7a963a06db13b68a6
#: ad982b843b00400c8dcb1f49255c3c35 f779be9a7007486cb258a6b453716d92
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:137
#: 048a6c5814a345c5b07798255acc9f1b 82ee637951e34693a13c82cc368b49fb
#: 90478f035f8440188f583b0c2d0b58f4 d4ba5d26e9c64a129e2ef4c3f1137fda
